  "ingredients": [
    "1/4 cup olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1 medium cauliflower (chopped)",
    "2 cup chicken broth",
    "1 cup water",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "1 1/2 cup cheddar cheese (shredded)",
    "2 slice cooked bacon (Chopped)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a deep pan, heat 3/4 of the olive oil and the garlic on medium heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup/#wprm-recipe-52758-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once hot, add in the cauliflower.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup/#wprm-recipe-52758-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in the chicken broth and water, bringing it to a boil over high heat. Stir frequently",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup/#wprm-recipe-52758-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once it’s boiling, stir in the heavy whipping cream and turn the heat down to medium.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup/#wprm-recipe-52758-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, whisk together the rest of your oil and xanthan gum to make a slurry. Drop your slurry into the soup and stir. It should start to thicken.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup/#wprm-recipe-52758-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Little by little, add in your cheese, stirring it into the soup so it melts.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup/#wprm-recipe-52758-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in the bacon and serve!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cheesy-cauliflower-bacon-soup/#wprm-recipe-52758-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
